diagnostics/nested-type-refusals.em:4:5: a nested type cannot be overridden
      @override
      ^^^^^^^^^
Nested types are not inherited, so there is nothing to replace. Remove `@override`.
diagnostics/nested-type-refusals.em:6:5: an enum cannot be abstract
      @abstract
      ^^^^^^^^^
Only a class can be `@abstract`, since only a class can be extended. Remove `@abstract`, or declare a class.
diagnostics/nested-type-refusals.em:11:5: a trait cannot declare a nested struct
      struct Guest {}
      ^^^^^^
A trait's body holds requirements and defaults. Declare the type at the top level, or inside a struct, class, or enum.
